Release Date: January 14th, 2019
==Update 29.4 Patch Notes==
<br>
'''NOTABLE BUGFIXES AND CHANGES'''
* Newly learned schematics will have the correct amount of unlocked cipher slots.
* Fixed a bug where schematics could have more cipher slots than the player had unlocked.
* Fixed a bug where players would be unable to listen to other players if the other players were quickly moving in and out of VoIP range.
* Reduced ship rubberbanding
** General ship motion is smoother now
** The black spinning circle will appear less frequently
** Ships won’t stop at server boundaries
** Ships positions should be closer to where they actually are on the server
